OL,3,GNEWSACouncil buys theatre shop units to
OL,4,Apreserve facade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town council has bought two retail
OL,7,Funits at the entrance of a 100-year-old
OL,8,FArt Deco theatre to preserve its
OL,9,Ffacade.
OL,11,FElectric Palace in Bridport, Dorset,
OL,12,Fwas put up for sale in May, along with
OL,13,Fthe shops and two apartments, for a
OL,14,Ftotal of #1.74m.
OL,16,FBridport Town Council said it would
OL,17,Facquire the units to provide "security
OL,18,Fand continuity" to the business that
OL,19,Foperate there and to protect the
OL,20,Fhistorical South Street frontage.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
